msgid "Server-side payments with Stripe, Google Play, App Store, and Steam providers. Validate receipts, process signed webhooks, grant entitlements, revoke refunds, and inspect everything in admin."
msgstr "Serverbaserade betalningar med Stripe, Google Play, App Store och Steam. Validera kvitton, hantera signerade webhooks, bevilja rättigheter, återkalla återbetalningar och granska allt i adminvyn."

